{"type": "text", "timestamp": 1791577388669, "sessionID": "ses_eddaca66affecEaHqA9PohZ5ZM", "part": {"id": "prt_1225540a3001NMX6TBOYZpECfP", "messageID": "msg_12255393e001kal1zpK9NoAuIn", "sessionID": "ses_eddaca66affecEaHqA9PohZ5ZM", "type": "text", "text": "## Successor and migration stage completed\n\nActual Lykoi MCP calls accepted both successors and recorded the total explicit family migration.\n\n### Admitted immutable pins\n\n| Definition | Successor pin |\n|---|---|\n| ReserveTotal | `7e5a51cb1739eedc43536690119b05c21ca6076cd478cfab8c536f130d16567a` |\n| CallerA | `14dc7b176cef6bba47085d565485145af7513ff79bff32d684d36f0238c839b8` |\n\nEach was admitted against its exact original predecessor.\n\n- **ReserveTotal:** retains revision 1, its signature, all checks, order `g1 \u2192 g2`, codes, sites, and source labels. Only the result changed to checked signed64 **`(x+y)+5`**.\n- **CallerA:** retains revision 1 and all other content. Only its dependency pin and compose-call identity changed.\n\n### Explicit family migration\n\n| Original caller | Decision |\n|---|---|\n| CallerA \u2014 `8074186e992b67e49da09671d46bd16ab8abffa84bb8215588d0373787b58305` | Select successor `14dc7b176cef6bba47085d565485145af7513ff79bff32d684d36f0238c839b8` |\n| CallerB \u2014 `5cff6ed35e3f5a67342f02efed5f8c7dce366e4cc16bc549686be14e40fea730` | **null / retain** |\n\nMigration status: **`migrated`**. Registry token:\n`8686328d9afba7a45c723a297ef641cd31f737d74cab873a6feb4d722c28ef09`\n\n### Retrieval and validation\n\nRetrieved the selected CallerA and retained CallerB closures. Both validated as **valid**, with **8 frozen-plan nodes each**. Retrieval confirmed that CallerB still depends on the original ReserveTotal.\n\n### Observed executions\n\n| Root | Input hex | Result |\n|---|---|---|\n| Selected CallerA | `0a14` | **39**, UInt16BE `0027` |\n| Selected CallerA | `6969` | **219**, UInt16BE `00db` |\n| Selected CallerA | `c864` | Reject: `PAIR_ORDER`, offset 0, label `g1` |\n| Selected CallerA | `646f` | Reject: `RESERVE_CAP`, offset 1, label `g2` |\n| Selected CallerA | `c86400` | Reject: `TRAILING`, offset 2, `input_end` |\n| Retained CallerB | `0a` | **27**, UInt16BE `001b` |\n| Retained CallerB | `65` | **209**, UInt16BE `00d1` |\n| Retained CallerB | `66` | Reject: `RESERVE_CAP`, offset 0, label `g2` |\n| Retained CallerB | `6600` | Reject: `TRAILING`, offset 1, `input_end` |\n| Original CallerA | `0a14` | **34**, UInt16BE `0022` |\n| Original CallerA | `6969` | **214**, UInt16BE `00d6` |\n\nThe original CallerA remains executable with its predecessor behavior. All rejection results are preserved above. No further successors or migrations were created.", "time": {"start": 1791577374883, "end": 1791577388667}, "metadata": {"openai": {"itemId": "msg_0e13686d4f57aa25016ac94d1fc638819aa5ec11192b9190bd", "phase": "final_answer"}}}}
